WEBVTT

00:01:56.396 --> 00:02:00.116
which would have posed serious
health and environmental risk

00:02:00.156 --> 00:02:02.156
to the Ekumfi population.

00:02:02.516 --> 00:02:04.156
In our part of the world,

00:02:04.196 --> 00:02:06.916
we have people who depend on water bodies,

00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:09.876
for bathing, for cooking,

00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:12.596
for washing and even for drinking.

00:02:13.316 --> 00:02:14.476
So what this means

00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:17.236
is that it's going to have
a devastating impact

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:20.956
on their source of livelihood
and their life as a whole.

00:02:21.436 --> 00:02:22.796
So this shows

00:02:22.836 --> 00:02:26.356
that the adverse impact of coal

00:02:26.356 --> 00:02:29.756
far outweighs the economic benefit.